o"><addressbook><name>DAIKIN IND LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant> <applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUMORI MASAKI</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HARA RYOSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYAHARA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AGA, TSUKASA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DAIKIN INDUSTRIES, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUMORI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HARA, RYOSUKE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAHARA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AGA TSUKASA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUMORI MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HARA RYOSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYAHARA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AGA, TSUKASA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUMORI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HARA, RYOSUKE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAHARA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An aqueous water-and-oil repellant dispersion containing (A) a homo- or copolymer of at least one polymerizable compound having a perfluoroalkyl or perfluoroalkenyl group and an acrylate or methacrylate group or a copolymer thereof with a copolymerizable compound, (B) surfactants comprising as essential ingredients a cationic surfactant and a nonionic surfactant consisting of an alkylene oxide adduct of a higher aliphatic secondary alcohol, and (C) an organic solvent having a high flash point.  It has long-lasting water and oil repellency and excellent storage stability.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une dispersion aqueuse hydrophobe et oléophobe renfermant: (A) un homopolymère ou un copolymère constitué d'au moins un composé polymérisable possédant un groupe perfluoroalkyle ou perfluoroalcényle et un groupe acrylate ou méthacrylate ou un copolymère de ceux-ci, et d'un composé copolymérisable; (B) des tensioactifs contenant comme ingrédients essentiels un tensioactif cationique et un tensioactif non ionique constitué d'un produit d'addition d'oxyde d'alkylène d'un alcool secondaire aliphatique supérieur; et (C) un solvant organique à point d'éclair élevé. Cette dispersion repousse de manière durable l'eau et l'huile et présente une excellente stabilité au stockage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agre